  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Adult female Mongolarachne jurassica reconstructed from the compressed holotype and revised interpretation. Body depth, colour, eyes, posture, missing leg tips and short palps are inferred; fine plumose setae are simplified. Relationships and web architecture remain uncertain, without implying modern Nephila identity or golden silk.",
    "zh": "Mongolarachne jurassica 成体雌蛛参考压扁模式化石及修订解释复原。体厚、颜色、眼、姿态、缺失足端与短触肢为推定，细小羽状刚毛已简化。亲缘及网结构仍不确定，不暗示现生 Nephila 身份或金色蛛丝。"
  },
